WEBVTT

00:17.726 --> 00:19.519
HONG MIN-BEOM

00:19.602 --> 00:20.770
Gang-yong?

00:20.854 --> 00:22.522
Yes. I'll be there in ten minutes.

00:22.605 --> 00:25.150
Director Hong, don't hang up the phone.

00:25.692 --> 00:27.193
Put it upside down on the table,

00:27.277 --> 00:29.654
so I can listen. Do you understand?

00:39.414 --> 00:40.749
Let me cut to the chase.

00:42.959 --> 00:43.918
What are you doing?

00:49.674 --> 00:51.926
Stop being a baby and sit still.

00:53.261 --> 00:54.095
Hear me?

00:54.179 --> 00:56.431
You bastard, what did you say?

00:56.514 --> 00:57.932
Do you have a death wish?

00:59.434 --> 01:02.145
You're making a huge fucking mistake,
you damn thug!

01:02.729 --> 01:03.730
Tell him to shut up.

01:05.398 --> 01:06.274
Gang-yong.

01:07.192 --> 01:09.819
- Be quiet!
- I'll make sure you rot in prison forever!

01:09.903 --> 01:10.779
You son of a bitch!

01:12.405 --> 01:14.949
Fuck! Shut the hell up,
you son of a bitch!

01:18.286 --> 01:19.120
Jackass.

01:21.873 --> 01:22.832
Are you calm now?

01:22.916 --> 01:24.459
GANG-YONG

01:25.627 --> 01:26.669
Answer me.

01:27.879 --> 01:29.005
What do you want?

01:29.589 --> 01:32.967
There's a report that came in
from Yeongmoonpo Police Department today.

01:33.051 --> 01:34.385
A guy on a motorcycle slashed

01:34.469 --> 01:37.347
a man's neck with a knife
in a parking lot, then got away.

01:38.014 --> 01:39.057
Write this down.

01:39.808 --> 01:44.479
Seoul, Gangdong, A 6438.

01:45.146 --> 01:48.024
It's a fake plate number,
so it won't show up in the database.

01:48.525 --> 01:50.527
Find where the guy
on this motorcycle went.

01:52.320 --> 01:53.613
In order to find this--

01:53.696 --> 01:55.365
I know it's hard and time-consuming.

01:56.032 --> 01:57.242
That's why I called you.

01:58.201 --> 02:00.453
It's 10:00 p.m. I'll give you five hours.

02:00.537 --> 02:01.913
If you can't find him,

02:03.456 --> 02:06.251
your little cousin's strip show
will go online.

02:06.334 --> 02:09.045
Try to pull something on me,
and it'll also go online.

02:09.712 --> 02:13.258
If you don't want to see lil Group's
stock prices go down tomorrow morning…

02:13.341 --> 02:14.175
Get it done.

02:18.596 --> 02:19.430
What is it?

02:20.181 --> 02:21.599
735629.

02:29.440 --> 02:30.316
See you again.

02:34.988 --> 02:36.156
Fuck!

03:07.020 --> 03:10.190
BLOODHOUNDS

03:17.155 --> 03:18.114
Hello, sir.

03:18.198 --> 03:20.074
- Come here, you punk.
- Salute!

03:20.158 --> 03:21.117
Damn it.

03:21.743 --> 03:23.036
Soju's on me. I'll buy.

03:30.585 --> 03:32.212
- This way, sir.
- Thank you.

03:32.712 --> 03:33.922
- Hello, sir.
- Hi.

03:35.506 --> 03:40.011
They boil the body for days
until the bones get soft.

03:40.094 --> 03:42.430
Then they grind them
and pour them into the ocean.

03:42.513 --> 03:44.557
Fifteen million
to get rid of a body that way.

03:44.641 --> 03:46.476
You won't be able to find a bone.

03:46.976 --> 03:49.145
Who boils people in stew?
These sick fucks.

03:49.729 --> 03:50.730
Who did you hear it from?

03:51.606 --> 03:52.982
Seung-deok in prison.

03:53.066 --> 03:55.193
How does he know all that from prison?

03:55.276 --> 03:57.862
Prison is always the fastest source
of information.

03:59.113 --> 04:00.823
Are you guys all right?

04:01.616 --> 04:02.992
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

04:03.076 --> 04:05.536
Witnessing that couldn't have been easy.

04:07.747 --> 04:11.626
By the way, what will happen
when the casino opens?

04:11.709 --> 04:12.710
What do you mean?

04:13.836 --> 04:15.588
Kim Myeong-gil will rake in the money.

04:15.672 --> 04:17.006
- I see.
- Gun-woo.

04:17.507 --> 04:18.341
Yes, sir.

04:18.424 --> 04:22.428
Gambling and drug addicts tend
to take out a lot of private loans.

04:22.512 --> 04:25.556
Kim Myeong-gil plans to connect
the casino with moneylending.

04:26.057 --> 04:30.478
The more people visit his casino,
the more people will take out loans.

04:30.561 --> 04:32.981
Money will flow in every day.

04:33.940 --> 04:35.984
But only foreigners can go to casinos.

04:37.568 --> 04:38.820
Do you think he cares?

04:38.903 --> 04:39.821
Oh.

04:40.405 --> 04:42.490
He'll let big spenders in
through the back.

04:42.573 --> 04:44.325
They won't make a lot operating legally.

04:45.451 --> 04:49.289
Once he's made enough money,
he'll take out a loan and buy a building.

04:49.372 --> 04:50.999
Then he'll use that as collateral

04:51.082 --> 04:53.668
for a bigger loan
and buy an even bigger building.

04:55.128 --> 04:56.713
That bastard is really something.

04:56.796 --> 05:00.258
He'll go harder running the casino
to pay back that loan.

05:00.341 --> 05:03.177
And Smile Capital will squeeze
even more people dry.

05:03.261 --> 05:05.722
It'll be the opening
of Kim Myeong-gil's empire.

05:18.192 --> 05:23.781
Myeong-gil roughly stole
over 20 billion from me back then.

05:23.865 --> 05:26.284
Once we get it back,

05:26.367 --> 05:29.829
shall we go on a world trip
with Gun-woo and Woo-jin?

05:30.955 --> 05:33.082
We have enough money as is.

05:35.084 --> 05:36.002
Yes,

05:36.919 --> 05:38.963
but we can't go anywhere
because of COVID-19.

05:40.840 --> 05:41.674
Well…

05:43.634 --> 05:44.635
Let's go to Rome.

05:47.555 --> 05:48.556
Why Rome?

05:48.639 --> 05:52.226
When I was 20, I watched
a film called Roman Holiday.

05:53.019 --> 05:56.356
I vowed to go someday
when I made a lot of money,

05:56.439 --> 05:57.857
but I haven't had the chance.

05:57.940 --> 06:01.611
I thought it might be nice
to go with you all,

06:02.195 --> 06:03.863
the three of you.

06:07.700 --> 06:09.827
I'll buy you guys anything you want.

06:10.912 --> 06:14.040
Grandpa, there are
a lot of expensive things in Italy.

06:14.123 --> 06:15.541
It's the land of luxuries.

06:16.125 --> 06:18.711
Hey, who do you think you're talking to?

06:19.796 --> 06:21.672
I'll show you how it's done.

06:23.800 --> 06:26.803
Grandpa, that's called "flex."

06:27.970 --> 06:31.474
Yes, I'll show you how to "flex."

06:32.850 --> 06:36.020
You don't show anything.
You just say "flex."

06:44.404 --> 06:48.282
Right, let's all go together
once this is all finished.

07:04.757 --> 07:05.591
Yes, sir.

07:06.884 --> 07:08.302
Okay, that sounds good.

07:09.345 --> 07:10.179
Yes, sir.

07:11.180 --> 07:14.392
Mr. Choi invited us to come over
for drinks at his place.

07:16.519 --> 07:18.020
I guess he's in a good mood.

07:19.605 --> 07:20.773
Do you guys drink?

07:21.941 --> 07:22.775
We'd love to go!

08:18.164 --> 08:19.457
Can you speed it up?

08:19.957 --> 08:21.834
Do you want double or quadruple-speed?

08:21.918 --> 08:23.252
- Let's do double.
- Okay.

08:30.092 --> 08:32.053
If I were Kim Myeong-gil,

08:32.136 --> 08:35.681
I would've moved the hard drive
to a safer location,

08:35.765 --> 08:38.434
assuming that Im Jang-do revealed
all of his weaknesses.

08:39.936 --> 08:41.771
Do you think he's able to pull that off?

08:41.854 --> 08:44.899
We've tied down
Kim Myeong-gil's arms and legs.

08:44.982 --> 08:48.528
He has no one left to mobilize
except for Jung now.

08:49.362 --> 08:50.238
Besides,

08:51.155 --> 08:54.116
I don't think Kim would entrust
just anyone with that information.

08:55.326 --> 08:56.911
He doesn't have to move it far.

08:57.411 --> 08:59.413
If he hid it in the trunk,
we wouldn't know.

09:00.164 --> 09:01.541
Kim Myeong-gil knows that.

09:02.291 --> 09:03.251
You're right.

09:03.918 --> 09:07.255
If we were to recruit
an enemy of his over to our side,

09:07.338 --> 09:09.215
the tides would turn in our favor.

09:11.551 --> 09:13.970
But in order to do that,
we need the hard drive.

09:14.053 --> 09:17.598
It should contain a lot of information
on Myeong-gil's blackmail victims.

09:18.099 --> 09:20.643
Those people have the same motive as us.

09:22.019 --> 09:26.399
There will be many powerful people,
like the Iil Group heir.

09:29.110 --> 09:31.821
The longer this fight goes on,
the more were at a disadvantage.

09:32.488 --> 09:35.741
I'm sure Myeong-gil has made
a vast network of connections by now.

09:36.367 --> 09:39.996
He will have every cop, prosecutor,
and politician that could be bought off

09:40.746 --> 09:42.039
in his pocket by now.

09:42.748 --> 09:45.668
If we let our guard down
for even a moment, we'll lose our edge.

09:46.627 --> 09:47.545
Right.

09:47.628 --> 09:51.173
But it's true we took down
three of his cronies, right?

09:51.882 --> 09:52.717
Yes.

09:53.718 --> 09:56.262
You're bound to get anxious
if you think too far ahead.

09:56.887 --> 09:59.599
The way I see it,
I think we're all doing pretty well.

09:59.682 --> 10:01.225
No one's gotten hurt so far.

10:01.892 --> 10:02.727
That's right.

10:03.561 --> 10:05.271
Let's take things one at a time.

10:05.354 --> 10:08.274
We can take Kim Myeong-gil down,
then his company.

10:09.025 --> 10:12.194
Besides, now that Im Jang-do
and Kim Jun-min are gone,

10:12.278 --> 10:14.530
Kim Myeong-gil probably got
a reality check.

10:17.158 --> 10:18.951
I guess you have a point.

10:20.828 --> 10:22.163
Well…

10:25.041 --> 10:26.792
Right.

10:26.876 --> 10:28.461
Mr. Choi. Dear seniors.

10:30.921 --> 10:36.135
I would like to propose a toast
for our safety and our shared goal.

10:36.802 --> 10:40.014
When I lead with,
"Let's find that hard drive,"

10:40.097 --> 10:45.186
please follow up with,
"Kim Myeong-gil is done for."

10:45.269 --> 10:47.355
Let's get started.
Please raise your glasses.

10:49.398 --> 10:51.692
Let's find that hard drive.
Kim Myeong-gil is…

10:51.776 --> 10:53.694
- Done for!
- Done for!

11:44.787 --> 11:46.539
Yes, I'm going to Joongang Station.

11:47.039 --> 11:49.291
Those bastards went
from Dongpa-gu to Joongang-gu.

11:50.084 --> 11:51.836
Can you find them by 3:00 p.m.?

11:52.837 --> 11:54.797
I can if they stopped in Joongang-gu,

11:54.880 --> 11:57.007
but if they crossed over
to another district,

11:57.091 --> 11:58.551
I'll have to keep looking.

12:00.344 --> 12:01.512
Please help me.

12:01.595 --> 12:03.097
Don't worry about it.

12:03.180 --> 12:05.725
We'll do what the bastard wants for now.

12:06.600 --> 12:09.979
Once it's done, I'll think of a way
to fuck this guy up.

12:10.855 --> 12:11.731
Thank you.

12:12.314 --> 12:16.527
Min-beom, you think I'd leave some bastard
messing with my family alone?

12:17.570 --> 12:18.404
Don't worry.

12:18.487 --> 12:19.572
Okay?

12:19.655 --> 12:21.198
You're all I have.

12:21.699 --> 12:24.243
Don't drink too much, okay?

12:24.910 --> 12:25.786
Okay.

12:46.515 --> 12:49.226
Gosh. Why did he drink so much
if he's such a lightweight?

12:49.310 --> 12:50.352
I guess

12:51.312 --> 12:52.772
he was in a good mood today.

12:52.855 --> 12:54.815
I'm sleepy. What about you?

12:54.899 --> 12:56.400
I'm heading back downstairs.

12:56.484 --> 12:58.235
- Aren't you tired?
- Yes, I'm fine.

13:01.947 --> 13:02.782
Good work today.

13:02.865 --> 13:03.824
Sure.

13:10.122 --> 13:10.956
Gun-woo.

13:12.416 --> 13:13.292
Gun-woo.

13:15.336 --> 13:16.253
Mom, aren't you asleep?

13:17.546 --> 13:18.923
No, why are you awake?

13:19.006 --> 13:21.008
I'm having a drink
with everyone downstairs.

13:21.634 --> 13:23.928
- You're drinking too?
- No, of course not.

13:24.011 --> 13:24.887
Goodness.

13:26.722 --> 13:28.933
I'll make hangover soup in the morning.

13:29.016 --> 13:30.935
Okay. Get some sleep. I'll close the door.

13:31.018 --> 13:32.561
Okay, sleep tight.

13:32.645 --> 13:33.813
Good night.

13:36.106 --> 13:38.859
It's nice drinking with you
after such a long time.

13:58.337 --> 13:59.171
Is it a woman?

13:59.755 --> 14:00.631
Yes.

14:01.131 --> 14:02.842
Who would call you at this hour?

14:07.221 --> 14:08.556
Tell me.

14:10.766 --> 14:11.600
Yang-jung.

14:14.478 --> 14:15.688
I'm going to be a dad.

14:17.523 --> 14:18.524
When?

14:19.108 --> 14:20.985
In two months. It's a girl.

14:23.571 --> 14:25.698
We've been together for over three years.

14:26.824 --> 14:30.077
If you had family,
you should've told me, you punk!

14:30.160 --> 14:32.746
Come on. Then you would've
told me not to come.

14:36.792 --> 14:38.544
Go home. I'll wrap things up here.

14:38.627 --> 14:40.963
No, it's been a while
since we had a drink together.

14:41.046 --> 14:42.131
I'm staying.

14:42.214 --> 14:43.632
I said go home.

14:44.550 --> 14:46.093
Man, that temper of yours.

14:49.054 --> 14:49.889
Hey.

14:50.931 --> 14:52.266
I'm good. I don't need it.

14:52.766 --> 14:55.352
It's not for you. Get your wife some meat.

14:55.436 --> 14:57.980
Iron intake is important
for pregnant women. Come on.

15:00.399 --> 15:01.817
This is too much.

15:05.195 --> 15:06.113
Are you coming?

15:06.196 --> 15:07.323
Yes, I'm coming.

15:07.406 --> 15:09.325
- All right. I'll go on ahead.
- Sure.

15:11.994 --> 15:13.078
Call a cab.

15:13.162 --> 15:15.414
I'll have another smoke
until it gets here.

15:17.374 --> 15:18.208
Yang-jung.

15:21.795 --> 15:22.630
Thanks.

15:24.048 --> 15:25.466
Cut it out.

15:28.719 --> 15:30.512
You're the best.

15:31.138 --> 15:33.307
I'm going to get some hanwoo
on my way back.

15:38.729 --> 15:40.731
Hyeon-ju says she's going to bed first.

15:40.814 --> 15:41.649
Okay.

15:44.193 --> 15:45.027
Are you all right?

15:45.736 --> 15:46.570
Yes, sir.

15:53.827 --> 15:55.496
You must be really worried.

15:56.163 --> 15:59.291
I'm the one who taught Myeong-gil.
He's my responsibility.

16:00.250 --> 16:02.211
But after my body broke down like this,

16:02.920 --> 16:04.213
I didn't have the courage

16:05.839 --> 16:06.674
to fight him.

16:09.385 --> 16:10.803
The only thing I could do was

16:11.887 --> 16:14.848
to take care of Hyeon-ju.

17:25.669 --> 17:26.795
Who are you?

17:27.713 --> 17:28.589
Well,

17:29.673 --> 17:30.674
I'm…

17:32.217 --> 17:33.218
your dad's friend.

17:38.682 --> 17:40.934
Don't cry.

17:41.435 --> 17:42.436
Please don't cry.

17:46.482 --> 17:48.484
Dad!

17:53.280 --> 17:56.617
CONDOLENCES

17:57.576 --> 17:58.911
What do you mean?

18:01.288 --> 18:05.125
Fill up this hall with the best
condolence flowers you can find.

18:05.209 --> 18:06.043
Yes, sir.

18:06.126 --> 18:09.546
Have ten of our men guard overnight
until they transport the coffin.

18:10.255 --> 18:12.132
- Should we arm them?
- No.

18:12.633 --> 18:14.843
It's because a kid is all by herself.

18:14.927 --> 18:16.178
Tell them to get her fed.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.221
Yes, sir.

18:18.639 --> 18:21.391
Sir, I think you left your scarf inside.

18:21.475 --> 18:22.768
No, never mind that.

18:25.395 --> 18:27.189
By the way, why'd he kill himself?

18:28.107 --> 18:30.984
He delivered papers in the morning,
assembled fan parts all day,

18:31.068 --> 18:32.778
and worked as a chauffeur at night.

18:32.861 --> 18:36.448
He got three hours of sleep, working
graveyard shifts to save his daughter.

18:36.532 --> 18:38.408
He endured that for two years.

18:38.492 --> 18:40.619
His child got better. Why kill himself?

18:41.703 --> 18:42.788
I don't see why.

18:43.705 --> 18:45.916
I lent him the money without any interest,

18:45.999 --> 18:47.501
so he only owed the principal.

18:48.001 --> 18:51.213
I said I'd give him an infinite extension
if he needed more time.

18:59.429 --> 19:00.347
I'll look into it.

19:00.931 --> 19:02.307
I don't understand.

19:10.524 --> 19:11.400
There.

19:15.946 --> 19:16.864
Third floor.

19:26.039 --> 19:26.874
Excuse me.

19:29.126 --> 19:29.960
You scared me.

19:30.544 --> 19:33.505
Are you on your way
to Mr. Cha Sang-ho's funeral?

19:35.174 --> 19:36.008
I am.

19:39.678 --> 19:43.307
Two years ago, when I had back surgery
and couldn't lift heavy things,

19:44.057 --> 19:48.353
Hyeon-ju's dad took out the trash for me
for three months.

19:49.855 --> 19:50.814
Goodness.

19:51.648 --> 19:54.610
He was the nicest,
most hard-working person around.

19:55.944 --> 19:57.779
I felt so bad for Hyeon-ju.

19:58.280 --> 20:01.450
That poor little thing was sick
without a mother around.

20:02.034 --> 20:04.828
I used to feed her and stock their fridge,

20:05.329 --> 20:07.206
so they didn't run out of food.

20:07.289 --> 20:11.168
Why would a man like that kill himself
now that Hyeon-ju has gotten better?

20:11.251 --> 20:14.421
It's because of those loan shark bastards!

20:15.964 --> 20:17.966
They came over whenever they pleased,

20:18.050 --> 20:20.093
grabbing him by the neck and beating him.

20:20.177 --> 20:22.054
Oh, dear me.

20:22.137 --> 20:23.096
What did they look like?

20:24.848 --> 20:27.893
One was built like a bear,

20:28.393 --> 20:31.104
and the other one was really tall.

20:34.107 --> 20:35.359
One month later,

20:35.984 --> 20:39.446
another person I lent money to
killed themselves.

20:40.113 --> 20:44.743
The person also had a sick family member,
so I gave them an interest-free loan.

20:46.161 --> 20:47.663
I'm going home too soon.

20:50.165 --> 20:51.166
Watch the stairs.

20:55.545 --> 20:56.713
God, my brother.

21:03.220 --> 21:04.096
I'll be going now.

21:05.722 --> 21:07.224
- Get home safe.
- Okay.

21:09.059 --> 21:10.060
Good night, Yang-jung.

21:16.358 --> 21:18.277
Yang-jung later found out

21:18.777 --> 21:23.615
that the people I extended these loans to
for their families' medical expenses…

21:25.367 --> 21:27.411
had been visited by Myeong-gil.

21:27.494 --> 21:29.454
He went around taking several million

21:29.538 --> 21:31.915
in loan extension fees
from those people every month,

21:33.208 --> 21:35.711
telling them that I had ordered it.

21:37.004 --> 21:40.215
My mom fell for the same trick.

21:41.967 --> 21:44.344
He hid a clause in fine print
within the contract.

21:47.139 --> 21:48.098
I see.

21:49.891 --> 21:51.143
I'm sorry.

21:52.144 --> 21:53.228
Not at all.

21:53.312 --> 21:55.856
A lot of people got hurt because of me.

21:56.648 --> 21:57.607
That's not true.

21:58.734 --> 22:01.320
Don't be sorry, Mr. Choi.

22:01.945 --> 22:04.197
You have a strong sense of responsibility,

22:04.281 --> 22:07.284
which is also why you feel so much guilt.

22:08.035 --> 22:10.871
Those who are truly shameless
feel no guilt whatsoever.

22:11.371 --> 22:15.334
They always blame others
and prey on those weaker than them.

22:17.252 --> 22:22.215
I believe we have all gathered here
thanks to the goodwill you've spread.

22:22.799 --> 22:28.013
I don't think Hyeon-ju knows
that you bought the orphanage for her,

22:28.597 --> 22:31.016
but she believes in you
with all her heart.

22:32.017 --> 22:35.103
We'll bring Kim Myeong-gil down
no matter what.

22:35.854 --> 22:37.481
So please stop blaming yourself,

22:39.316 --> 22:41.276
and look after your health, sir.

22:55.165 --> 22:59.836
Once this is all over, I'll set you up
with your very own private boxing gym

22:59.920 --> 23:04.049
that can help you focus on
your training until you become champion.

23:04.841 --> 23:08.845
And I'll build a nice big café
for your mom on the first floor.

23:09.971 --> 23:12.057
No rent until the day I die.

23:13.308 --> 23:14.559
Well…

23:17.813 --> 23:20.273
Don't know what to say?

23:20.357 --> 23:21.191
No.

23:23.360 --> 23:24.736
A thank you would do.

23:26.154 --> 23:26.988
I see.

23:28.115 --> 23:29.533
Thank you, Mr. Choi.

23:29.616 --> 23:30.534
No.

23:32.702 --> 23:34.413
I should be thanking you.

23:36.289 --> 23:38.458
You're teaching me
what youth is all about.

23:40.961 --> 23:41.878
This is…

23:46.466 --> 23:47.467
Do you like it?

23:47.551 --> 23:48.718
Well, yes.

23:53.723 --> 23:54.599
Let's look there.

23:54.683 --> 23:56.518
- Here?
- No, the one next to it.

23:56.601 --> 23:57.519
All right.

24:14.119 --> 24:15.078
How about that part?

24:15.745 --> 24:16.872
All right.

24:31.094 --> 24:32.304
- Thank you.
- Okay.

24:32.387 --> 24:33.221
Good work.

24:47.319 --> 24:48.487
GANG-YONG

24:50.572 --> 24:52.824
- Yes.
- 88 Onyu-ro.

24:53.909 --> 24:54.784
Happy now?

24:55.869 --> 24:57.204
Thank you for your hard work.

25:08.298 --> 25:10.008
- Let's go.
- Yes, sir!

26:29.963 --> 26:32.090
I guess President Choi is on crutches now.

26:46.730 --> 26:48.273
They tortured him with salt water.

26:50.525 --> 26:51.776
You think Jang-do ratted us out?

26:52.444 --> 26:53.737
I'm not sure, sir.

26:56.615 --> 26:59.284
In this case,
it's safe to assume that he did.

27:00.493 --> 27:02.078
Let's get President Choi first,

27:04.289 --> 27:05.332
then get him.

27:06.499 --> 27:07.542
Yes, sir.

27:12.631 --> 27:13.465
Sir.

27:18.887 --> 27:21.056
LEE DU-YEONG

27:29.606 --> 27:32.025
Don't get worked up
and kill him or anything.

27:32.651 --> 27:34.027
I need to ask him something.

27:34.110 --> 27:34.944
Yes, sir.

27:35.612 --> 27:37.906
- And take off that thing on your ear.
- Right.

28:07.769 --> 28:08.603
Du-yeong.

28:10.021 --> 28:11.940
I think someone's at the door.

28:28.081 --> 28:29.332
Who is it?

28:29.416 --> 28:33.128
I'm from downstairs.
There's water leaking from my ceiling.

28:33.962 --> 28:36.172
Can I briefly come in
to check your bathroom?

28:40.760 --> 28:42.721
I promise it won't take long.
My house is flooded.

28:44.806 --> 28:46.266
My kids can't sleep.

28:48.977 --> 28:50.270
I'd really appreciate it.

28:53.398 --> 28:54.482
Right now?

28:54.566 --> 28:56.109
Yes, it won't take long.

28:56.985 --> 28:58.486
I'll just check the situation.

29:12.125 --> 29:13.001
Honey?

29:13.752 --> 29:14.586
Yes?

29:17.172 --> 29:19.841
- Who is it?
- He says water is leaking downstairs.

29:23.428 --> 29:24.512
- Move over.
- What?

29:24.596 --> 29:25.430
Move over.

29:39.194 --> 29:40.278
- Just a second.
- Okay.

29:55.376 --> 29:59.047
Honey, call the cops
and report a burglary in progress.

29:59.839 --> 30:00.882
Why?

30:00.965 --> 30:02.300
I'll explain later.

30:03.134 --> 30:04.135
You trust me, right?

30:05.094 --> 30:05.929
Yes.

30:06.012 --> 30:07.263
And

30:07.889 --> 30:09.057
no matter what happens,

30:10.600 --> 30:12.268
do not open the door.

30:12.852 --> 30:13.686
Okay.

30:15.563 --> 30:16.523
Okay.

30:16.606 --> 30:18.775
It's all right, honey.

30:18.858 --> 30:20.777
Nothing's going to happen. It's all right.

30:25.406 --> 30:26.908
Jeez.

30:51.224 --> 30:52.392
Samjin-dong, Dongjak-gu.

31:06.698 --> 31:10.159
Please hurry. My husband's in danger.

31:21.087 --> 31:24.048
- Hey, hurry and jump over.
- We need to get him out of there.

31:27.218 --> 31:28.303
What the fuck?

31:29.971 --> 31:30.805
Fuck!

31:32.348 --> 31:35.101
Fuck, you bastard!

31:36.978 --> 31:38.146
You bastard!

31:56.706 --> 31:59.000
Motherfucker! Son of a bitch!

32:01.878 --> 32:03.087
Get up, you fucker!

32:06.174 --> 32:07.342
Son of a bitch!

33:21.708 --> 33:23.710
If you tell me where Hwang Yang-jung is,

33:25.169 --> 33:26.671
I'll let your girl live.

33:31.384 --> 33:32.760
I always keep my promise

33:34.137 --> 33:35.179
no matter what.

33:41.769 --> 33:42.645
You can trust me.

34:13.301 --> 34:15.011
- Did you sleep well, Mr. Choi?
- I did.

34:16.679 --> 34:17.722
Did you sleep well?

34:17.805 --> 34:19.015
- And you?
- I did.

34:22.060 --> 34:22.935
Come on over.

34:26.564 --> 34:28.274
I can't believe this is happening.

34:28.983 --> 34:30.985
Indeed. This is quite the gathering.

34:32.361 --> 34:34.197
Woo-jin, get up. Okay?

34:34.280 --> 34:35.239
Let's eat.

34:38.367 --> 34:40.203
- Thank you so much.
- Not at all.

34:43.289 --> 34:45.291
- He's not coming?
- He won't get up.

34:45.374 --> 34:47.668
You should've told him to eat
and then sleep.

34:48.252 --> 34:49.629
He drank a lot yesterday.

34:49.712 --> 34:50.922
He did.

34:51.005 --> 34:53.132
I guess being good at drinking
was all talk.

34:54.717 --> 34:55.635
Let's eat now.

34:55.718 --> 34:56.928
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

34:57.011 --> 34:58.471
Thank you for this meal.

35:09.982 --> 35:11.067
- Gun-woo.
- Yes, Mr. Choi.

35:11.150 --> 35:13.361
When are you taking your mother
to the orphanage?

35:13.986 --> 35:16.531
Let me borrow your car, Grandpa.
I'll do it.

35:16.614 --> 35:20.076
It was parked out there for a while.
It might be dangerous, so be careful.

35:20.159 --> 35:21.786
- I'll take care of it.
- All right.

35:21.869 --> 35:24.956
Want to go after we eat?
It'll only take us an hour at this time.

35:26.624 --> 35:27.542
Mom, is that okay?

35:27.625 --> 35:29.293
Well,

35:29.836 --> 35:34.715
I think I'd feel better if I stayed here,
preparing meals for everyone.

35:37.802 --> 35:38.636
Mrs. Yoon.

35:40.054 --> 35:42.098
I don't mean to impose,

35:43.099 --> 35:45.476
but would you mind helping out
at our orphanage?

35:47.395 --> 35:50.106
Your cooking skills are really impressive.

35:50.648 --> 35:52.733
I think the children would love it.

35:54.569 --> 35:57.029
This food is just amazing.

36:01.242 --> 36:03.244
Mom, I think that would be for the best.

36:08.249 --> 36:10.459
Yes, if it helps in any way.

36:10.543 --> 36:11.377
Thank you.

36:13.254 --> 36:14.130
Sure.

36:26.893 --> 36:30.688
You won't skip meals
even without me, right?

36:32.106 --> 36:33.191
Of course.

36:40.615 --> 36:41.782
Stay safe.

36:44.035 --> 36:44.869
Okay.

36:50.499 --> 36:51.584
Don't worry too much.

36:55.463 --> 36:56.672
I believe in my son.

36:56.756 --> 36:57.632
Okay.

37:18.236 --> 37:21.030
HWANGSUSA

37:30.039 --> 37:31.916
SECURITY DISABLED

37:35.795 --> 37:36.796
Min-dong.

38:28.264 --> 38:29.348
How did you find me?

38:30.599 --> 38:31.434
Well,

38:32.685 --> 38:34.520
Lee Du-yeong told me.

38:37.398 --> 38:39.275
Did you do something to his girl?

38:40.151 --> 38:41.068
Whoa.

38:43.779 --> 38:44.655
Did you kill them?

43:26.937 --> 43:27.771
Let's go.

43:50.461 --> 43:51.420
Mr. Choi!

43:52.630 --> 43:55.591
- Kim Myeong-gil's thugs are here.
- What are you talking about?

44:04.224 --> 44:06.518
Let's go to the basement. There's a gun.

44:18.781 --> 44:20.824
I'll stay behind. Hurry and get the gun.

44:21.492 --> 44:22.326
Hey, Woo-jin!

44:22.409 --> 44:23.410
Damn it.

44:23.494 --> 44:25.162
- Woo-jin, get out!
- Get the gun!

44:25.245 --> 44:26.455
Woo-jin, come here!

44:33.212 --> 44:35.130
- Hey, get him!
- Woo-jin!

44:36.674 --> 44:37.591
- Woo-jin!
- Fuck.

44:38.425 --> 44:39.259
Get out of there!

44:43.597 --> 44:44.848
Hey, you son of a bitch!

44:44.932 --> 44:46.225
Get down there fast!

44:50.521 --> 44:51.563
Fuck!

44:55.484 --> 44:56.819
- Get in there!
- Hey!

45:07.830 --> 45:09.039
You son of a bitch!

45:14.128 --> 45:15.754
Hey, go!

45:17.923 --> 45:19.133
You punk!

45:20.968 --> 45:22.052
Hey!

45:30.018 --> 45:31.019
Get out!

45:52.958 --> 45:53.959
Fuck!

45:55.335 --> 45:56.545
You son of a bitch!

46:40.005 --> 46:41.048
Fuck.

46:41.548 --> 46:42.633
You son of a bitch!

47:06.865 --> 47:09.117
Woo-jin!

47:26.510 --> 47:27.845
Woo-jin!

48:17.603 --> 48:18.520
Where is he?

48:18.604 --> 48:19.563
This way, sir.

48:20.188 --> 48:21.899
- Get pouring.
- Yes, sir.

48:28.989 --> 48:30.240
Blood, damn it.

48:46.798 --> 48:47.633
Good job.

48:48.133 --> 48:48.967
Yes, sir.

48:55.724 --> 48:56.850
I owe you…

48:58.894 --> 49:00.354
a debt of gratitude.

49:00.437 --> 49:01.939
Over here.

49:04.274 --> 49:05.192
See,

49:06.193 --> 49:07.194
you gave me a dream.

49:08.070 --> 49:08.946
You…

49:15.243 --> 49:16.078
That's why…

49:19.039 --> 49:20.666
I'm going to make this painless.

49:21.291 --> 49:22.125
It's all right.

49:24.252 --> 49:27.005
It'll be over quickly. It's all right.

49:27.673 --> 49:29.049
Yes, there you go.

49:34.054 --> 49:36.098
Yes, it's all right.

50:19.933 --> 50:21.184
Gun-woo.

50:36.825 --> 50:38.243
- Try the back door.
- Okay.

50:51.423 --> 50:53.508
Woo-jin!

51:06.063 --> 51:06.897
Woo-jin!

51:35.258 --> 51:36.384
Hyeon-ju!

51:37.761 --> 51:39.096
Hyeon-ju!

51:44.017 --> 51:45.435
Just hold on.

51:47.354 --> 51:48.188
Grandpa.

51:51.733 --> 51:52.567
Grandpa.

51:53.068 --> 51:56.446
Grandpa…

51:56.530 --> 51:58.865
Oh God. Grandpa.

52:00.200 --> 52:01.284
Grandpa.

52:05.497 --> 52:06.414
Get up.

52:11.253 --> 52:14.589
Oh God. Gun-woo!

52:15.173 --> 52:16.883
Grandpa!

52:16.967 --> 52:18.426
Jeez. Gun-woo!

52:19.886 --> 52:22.389
Grandpa, please get up.

52:23.348 --> 52:26.560
Gun-woo, please help.

52:28.854 --> 52:30.939
Grandpa, please…

52:31.022 --> 52:32.691
- Hyeon-ju, we have to get out.
- No!

52:32.774 --> 52:35.277
- We have to! Hurry!
- No, we can't! Let go!

52:35.360 --> 52:36.570
You'll die if you stay!

52:36.653 --> 52:39.906
Grandpa!

52:43.869 --> 52:45.120
Grandpa!

52:59.885 --> 53:00.719
Scalpel.

53:04.806 --> 53:06.433
Prepare some more gauze, please.

53:12.022 --> 53:13.190
How's the patient?

53:13.273 --> 53:15.317
BP's at 80/50!
Beginning blood transfusion!

53:15.400 --> 53:18.236
We're short on blood due to COVID.
We need an outside source.

53:18.320 --> 53:20.030
Get us as much as you can.

53:28.079 --> 53:29.080
What do we do?

53:29.164 --> 53:31.374
- Then what do we do?
- If there's anyone else--

53:31.458 --> 53:32.876
- Gun-woo!
- What is it?

53:32.959 --> 53:34.502
Not enough blood for Woo-jin.

53:34.586 --> 53:36.171
- What?
- What's your blood type?

53:36.254 --> 53:37.756
It's Type A.

53:37.839 --> 53:39.049
- Come with me.
- Okay.

53:42.594 --> 53:45.180
I'll save Woo-jin no matter what,
so don't worry. Okay?

53:45.263 --> 53:46.264
Okay.

54:00.320 --> 54:01.488
He's bleeding a lot.

54:01.571 --> 54:04.032
Please prepare plenty of blood.

54:05.116 --> 54:06.076
We need more gauze.

54:06.868 --> 54:07.953
Please hurry.

54:09.996 --> 54:10.997
It's done.

54:11.081 --> 54:13.458
Is this enough to save Hong Woo-jin?

54:13.541 --> 54:15.585
No, I think we'll need a couple more.

54:15.669 --> 54:16.503
I see.

54:17.003 --> 54:19.172
Then let me fill up another one.

54:19.256 --> 54:21.466
We already got 320 ml.
Any more will be risky.

54:21.549 --> 54:24.761
I'm all right. I'm a boxer.
It'll take more than this to kill me.

54:24.844 --> 54:25.762
- I'm okay.
- No.

54:25.845 --> 54:29.516
I really have to save him, please.

54:30.725 --> 54:32.519
Please let me fill up another one.

54:32.602 --> 54:34.145
- Please, I beg you.
- I can't.

54:34.229 --> 54:35.981
This won't kill me, really.

54:36.815 --> 54:39.985
Please, I have to save Woo-jin.

54:40.068 --> 54:41.027
I have to save him.

54:41.528 --> 54:46.324
Please, I'm begging you.
This won't kill me.

54:46.408 --> 54:48.952
- I can't see due to the blood. Suction!
- Applying suction.

54:49.452 --> 54:52.414
I can't control the bleeding.
Please prepare the Surgicel.

54:52.497 --> 54:54.249
Surgicel ready.

54:54.332 --> 54:56.751
Keep it coming. I'll need more.

54:56.835 --> 54:59.337
BP is dropping! Please hurry!
